      "foaf:homepage": "https://nccrdataplatform.ccdi.cancer.gov/data-browser/MCD",
      "dct:description": "Patient diagnosis data extracted from medical claims collected by various insurers. Includes the ICD-9 or ICD-10 diagnosis code associated with each claim, sequence numbers for diagnosis codes occurring on multiple claims within the same month, and months elapsed between the index cancer diagnosis and the service date of the claim. Contains 54,148,739 records.",
